{"metadata": {"team_id": "Organizers", "run_id": "orga-ance-llama70b", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "2-1_2", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "You need to grind the coffee beans yourself to make a good cup of coffee. If you have a drip coffee maker, steer clear of pre-ground coffee. Get quality coffee beans and grind them yourself. A medium or dark roast is a good idea, especially if you want a chilled drink like those made with Japanese drip coffee. Grind Size: If your coffee beans are ground too finely, your coffee will be over-extracted and bitter. You need to strike the right balance with your drip coffee grind size. On the other hand, if the coffee grains are too big the water will pass through them quickly, resulting in under-extracted coffee that is flat and weak. For most auto-drip coffee makers, you will need a fine or medium grind based on the kind of drip coffee filters. If you have flat bottom filters, a medium grind with a sand-like texture is best.  You can use the coffee bean powder again, but it will not be as strong as what it was before.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0017-78-13948:2": 7.772420406341553, "clueweb22-en0009-97-05526:9": 7.735393047332764, "clueweb22-en0027-74-19922:3": 7.654086589813232, "clueweb22-en0017-78-13948:8": 7.454429626464844, "clueweb22-en0019-72-18743:2": 7.406915664672852}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I get grumpy if I don't get my coffee.", "I start my day by drinking coffee.", "I own a cooking machine."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0017-78-13948:2": 7.772420406341553, "clueweb22-en0009-97-05526:9": 7.735393047332764, "clueweb22-en0027-74-19922:3": 7.654086589813232, "clueweb22-en0017-78-13948:8": 7.454429626464844, "clueweb22-en0019-72-18743:2": 7.406915664672852, "clueweb22-en0023-19-14325:17": 7.185012340545654, "clueweb22-en0044-80-01204:7": 7.129970073699951, "clueweb22-en0044-80-01204:8": 7.124305248260498, "clueweb22-en0000-59-17225:6": 7.004925727844238, "clueweb22-en0030-86-02389:12": 6.975407600402832, "clu